    "detail": "Stayed at Sky hotel studio room on 31st oct was great. Love the comfy and spacious room , living room & kitchen so clean and stylish. I love my room views up from the 13a floors. I've enjoyed viewing the sunset next to the swimming pool at the top floor. Small pool but the views of KK city just make it priceless. Cleanliness and facilities of the hotel is fantastic. Staffs are friendly and very helpful. I got free upgrade to deluxe room on my 2nd night of stay at the 9th floors because of a private party held at the hotel lounge on 13ath floor and to make sure I'll not get disturb with the noises. The staff explained was very polite. Overall, it was a great stay..and for sure will come back here again...this hotel definitely recommend! ",
